{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aThe Weaver\u300b is an action RPG inspired by the Eastern philosophy of the Five Elements (Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By entering your birthdate, you are granted one of these elemental powers and become an exorcist who fights off evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smart Combat Using Five Elements and Their Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the powers of Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water exist. <br>Each element can either support or counter the others. <br>By learning how these elements interact, you can gain the upper hand in battle. <br>Gradually discover which element benefits you\u2014or puts you at a disadvantage\u2014and craft your own strategic playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.poster.avif?t=1755045349\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.webm?t=1755045349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.mp4?t=1755045349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tension-Filled Physical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelm your enemies with skill-based combo attacks, precise dodges, and sharp parries. <br>No matter how strong your opponent is, your agility will keep you one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.poster.avif?t=1755045349\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.webm?t=1755045349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.mp4?t=1755045349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Version Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo version of <i>The Weaver</i>, even if you enter your birthdate, your character's elemental attribute will be fixed to <strong>Fire</strong>, rather than being assigned based on your actual birthdate.<br>The gameplay is also limited to the tutorial section.<br>If you're curious about the other four elements and the story beyond the tutorial, we invite you to enjoy the demo to the fullest!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888260?t=1755045349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/a483c179e0622936f38bcd80dcf0c75c6c566b21/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755045349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/19990de9fb20175c292a8ad86c358fc4845fe725/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755045349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/19990de9fb20175c292a8ad86c358fc4845fe725/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755045349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aThe Weaver\u300b is an action RPG inspired by the Eastern philosophy of the Five Elements (Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By entering your birthdate, you are granted one of these elemental powers and become an exorcist who fights off evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smart Combat Using Five Elements and Their Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the powers of Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water exist. <br>Each element can either support or counter the others. <br>By learning how these elements interact, you can gain the upper hand in battle. <br>Gradually discover which element benefits you\u2014or puts you at a disadvantage\u2014and craft your own strategic playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.poster.avif?t=1755045349\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.webm?t=1755045349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.mp4?t=1755045349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tension-Filled Physical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelm your enemies with skill-based combo attacks, precise dodges, and sharp parries. <br>No matter how strong your opponent is, your agility will keep you one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.poster.avif?t=1755045349\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.webm?t=1755045349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.mp4?t=1755045349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Version Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo version of <i>The Weaver</i>, even if you enter your birthdate, your character's elemental attribute will be fixed to <strong>Fire</strong>, rather than being assigned based on your actual birthdate.<br>The gameplay is also limited to the tutorial section.<br>If you're curious about the other four elements and the story beyond the tutorial, we invite you to enjoy the demo to the fullest!</p>","developers":["Team Destiny"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3852900","name":"The Weaver"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888260/cff77244cf1271e206706316d2fdf793cb03789b/header.jpg?t=1755045349","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257173817,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173817/movie480.mp4?t=1755045347","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173817/movie_max.mp4?t=1755045347"},"name":"The Weaver Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257173817/638a3556281f9b936bafa7f55b52423b7abe66de/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755045347","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173817/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755045347","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257173817/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755045347"}}],"name":"The Weaver Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong